[D Quests for Upper Blackrock Spire \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 58-60 Upper Blackrock Spire]
[NX 59-60 Stratholme Living]

Upper Blackrock Spire sits at the top of Blackrock Mountain, the volcano between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes. Inside the mountain, climb to the high ledge and take the Spire portal, then run through Lower Blackrock Spire to the sealed door; the Seal of Ascension opens it. Do the Lower Blackrock Spire guide first: it gives Seal of Ascension (4742), Warlord's Command (4903) and General Drakkisath's Command (5089). Tinkee's egg chain needs a trip to Winterspring before the first run, and the Seal needs a trip to Emberstrife in Dustwallow Marsh.

-- Left out: 6566 to 6570, 6582 to 6585, 6601, 6602 (Horde) and 6502 with its Windsor chain (Alliance): the Onyxia attunement, owned by the Onyxia guide; 6569 Oculus Illusions only drops in Upper Blackrock Spire but needs Rexxar's chain first. 6821 Eye of the Emberseer: Molten Core attunement for the Hydraxian Waterlords. 5161, 5162, 5164 and 5166/5167: Haleh's Winterspring and Western Plaguelands follow-ups and armor rewards after 5160. 5063, 5067, 5068: Malyfous's crafting exchanges after 5047. 8966, 8989, 8995 and the rest of the Bodley and Lord Valthalak chain (8962 to 8998): dungeon-set upgrade chain that needs level 58 quests in every dungeon and Alcaz Island first (QuestieDB), left out as in the Dire Maul North guide. 4788 The Final Tablets and 5065: Prospector Ironboot's Tanaris chain; 5065's tablets are in the Eastern Plaguelands and 4788's lie in Vosh'gajin's and Voone's rooms in Lower Blackrock Spire (Wowhead quest 4788), not in Upper. 5103 and 5306: Winterspring crafting quests whose items come from Lower Blackrock Spire (QuestieDB 5306 Vosh'gajin's Snakestone). 5531 and 4771 after 5522: Scholomance guide. 7761 Blackhand's Command: the Blackwing Lair attunement, owned by the Blackwing Lair guide; it starts from item 18987, which the Scarshield Quartermaster drops per Dungeon Journal and Wowhead (unverified on Forever; QuestieDB lists no drop source) and ends at Drakkisath's Brand.

